# Personal exports and backups must never end up in this public repo.
# This is a defense-in-depth measure — these shouldn't be inside repo/ at all
# (they belong in the sibling Backup/ folder, outside any git repo), but if
# one ever gets copied back in by mistake, this stops it from being staged
# without an explicit `git add -f`.

Backup/
*[Bb]ackup*
*.xlsx
*.xls
*[Ll]ogin*
*[Ss]ecret*
PROJECT_SECRETS_LOCAL_ONLY.md
